{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>But I will remember them.</b> At the ingathering of the exiles." "<b>Whom I brought out, etc., to be their Elohim.</b> That I brought them out so that I would be their Elohim, as it says: וְאַתֶּם תִּהְיוּ לִי מַמְלֶכֶת כֹּהֲנִים וְגוֹי קָדוֹשׁ (Exodus 19:6). And what they corrupted then will be fulfilled after the ingathering of exiles, in the days of the Messiah and the world to come." "<b>I am HaShem.</b> I have not changed, and the corruption was from no one but them; and I will fulfill My intent once all their corruption has ceased, in the time to come."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:22.758800826Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}